<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in active trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 47.33 to 7020.13.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 1.50 to 425.57.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.16.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1283 to 1269.</p>
<p>Volume was 519,272,920 compared with 474,067,030 on Tuesday.</p>
